<!-- Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) -->
<section class="container mb-5">
  <div class="text-center mb-4">
    <h6 class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase small mb-1">Common Questions</h6>
    <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <div class="accordion shadow-sm" id="faqAccordion">
        <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-2 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHeading1">
            <button class="accordion-button fw-bold collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse1">
              Who can offer freelance services on SkillBridge?
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div id="faqCollapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeading1" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
              Enrolled university students with verifiable skills in software development, design, content writing, AI, and tutoring can register as Student Freelancers. Their profiles can be verified by university administrators.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-2 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHeading2">
            <button class="accordion-button fw-bold collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse2">
              How does the Student Skill Passport calculate metrics?
            </button>
          </h2>
          <div id="faqCollapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeading2" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body text-muted small">
              The metrics displayed on every student profile are dynamically calculated from real database orders and verified client reviews. Completed order counts and star ratings are mathematically aggregated using MongoDB queries.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-2 rounded-3 overflow-hidden border">
          <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHeading3">
            <button class="accordion-button fw-bold collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapse3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapse3">
              How are client reviews protected from manipulation?
            </button>
          </h2>
